  "description": "CR 715.2b, 715.2c, 703.4f, 715.4, 603.7, 603.7b: Thunder of Unity's chapter I draws two and loses 2 life; chapters II and III each create a delayed trigger that drains each opponent for each creature its controller has enter that turn, which outlives the saga's sacrifice",
  "note": "Three seats, so each opponent is two players. The Grizzly Bears cast on turn 1 drains nobody: no chapter II or III has resolved. Turn 4's chapter II drains bob and carol for the second Bears and again for an Ornithopter, since a delayed trigger lasting this turn triggers each time (CR 603.7b). Ambush Viper flashed in on bob's turn 5 drains nobody: the delayed trigger lasted only turn 4. Turn 7's chapter III resolves, the saga is sacrificed, and the third Bears still drains, since a delayed trigger is independent of its source.",
